{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed FEW_SHOT_EXAMPLES for the caregiver_infant persona, one entry per",
    "language code in android SupportedLanguages.ALL. Same shape as the",
    "per-file examples under this directory: each language has a",
    "`language_display` string and exactly two `few_shot_examples` demos,",
    "each demo being a `heard` phrase plus three `responses`.",
    "",
    "Purpose: give every supported target language a working default so the",
    "prompt isn't Russian-only, and give users something to override. The",
    "planned Settings screen lets a user edit, per language, both demos'",
    "`heard` phrase and their three `responses`; this file is what those",
    "editors start from.",
    "",
    "Only the Russian block is battle-tested (it matches",
    "what_else.ru.caregiver_infant.json). The rest are reasonable",
    "translations of the same two scenarios (putting on pajamas / reading a",
    "favorite book) in an infant-directed, diminutive-friendly register,",
    "and are NOT verified by a native speaker yet."
  ],
